=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Flapano} (I-8) to begin the quest.
* He requires 1 {i:Saffron|Saffron|3916}, 2 {i:Barnacles|Barnacle|5954}, and 1 {i:Mussel|Mussel|5949} to complete a dish.
** **{i:Saffron|Saffron|3916}** is obtained from the synthesis of 3 {i:Saffron Blossoms|Saffron Blossom|3915}, which are obtained by harvesting in {z:Foret de Hennetiel}, using a {i:Wind Crystal|Wind Crystal|4098}.
** **{i:Barnacles|Barnacle|5954}** can be obtained from the synthesis of {i:Carrier Crab Carapace|Carrier Crab Carapace|3940}, which drops from {m:Barnacle Crab} (**{p:G|Guaranteed (100%)}**) and {m:Depthswalker Crabs|Depthswalker Crab} (**{p:C|Common (15%)}**) in {z:Rala Waterways}, and a {i:Lightning Crystal|Lightning Crystal|4100}. (Enter from {z:Western Adoulin} (K-8) by the Big Bridge).
*** Also can be fished in {z:Western Adoulin} with {p:Sabiki Rig} or {p:Shrimp Lure}.
** **{i:Mussels|Mussel|5949}** can be obtained by fishing on the secret beach in {z:Foret de Hennetiel} with {i:Robber Rig|Robber Rig|17002} or {p:Rogue Rig}.
* Return with the ingredients for your reward.

